  "body": "# Low fire on your screen! For versions from 1.21.9 down to 1.8!\n# **(NO OPTIFINE NEEDED!)**\n\n# ✔️ When you are on fire, flames does not cover your whole screen but only a small fraction of it\n![Lower fire on the screen](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RRxvWKNC/images/2b55a22edb056644e597287e34b0fe6cf0400ba6.png)\n# ✔️ Fire on the ground is unchanged unlike in other packs\n![Normal fire on the ground](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RRxvWKNC/images/666aa8d07e705ded617913e6ddb19973bbfd3231.png)\n# Perfect for PvP or just your regular minecraft survival gameplay\n![Selected](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b3ce73ec529c01ee05c5f056a55db8a8095e6f2_0.webp)",
